                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On April 21 Secretary Acheson requested the Department of the Army to instruct
                    General Clay to deliver the Foreign Ministers’ message immediately. The
                    Department of the Army agreed to this procedure, and on April 22 the liaison
                    officers transmitted the message to the Parliamentary Council. For the text of
                    the message, see <ref target="#pg186">page 186</ref>.</p>
            </div>
